# mcpp build artefacts
target/
gcm.cache/
# Resolution record, not a pin — the file says so itself: "It does not yet pin
# future builds: index dependencies are re-resolved from their constraints each
# time." A library's consumers re-resolve from its constraints, so committing it
# records one machine's resolution and changes nothing about anyone else's.
# Every other mcpplibs package ignores it, including the scaffold template.
mcpp.lock
# mcpp writes this beside the manifest on every build
compile_commands.json
